# Test do-notation with MonadMaybe short-circuits on None
# [do MonadMaybe [x: None] [Some [+ x 1]]]
# → [MonadMaybe.bind None [fn [x] [Some [+ x 1]]]]
# → None (short-circuits because bind on None returns None)
[do MonadMaybe [x: None] [Some [+ x 1]]]

=== out
Variant(Maybe.None, Null)

=== warn
expected record type, got <error> at 1:1-1:1
